  "instructions": [
    "In a large bowl, whisk together flour, sugar, baking powder, cinnamon, nutmeg, and cayenne pepper.",
    "In a separate bowl, whisk together eggs, milk, and melted butter.",
    "Add the dry ingredients to the wet ingredients and stir until smooth.",
    "Cut the ripe bananas into 1-inch pieces and add to the batter.",
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a deep frying pan to 350°F.",
    "Using a spoon, drop the banana batter into the hot oil, making sure not to overcrowd the pan.",
    "Fry the banana fritters for 2-3 minutes on each side, or until golden brown.",
    "Using a slotted spoon, remove the fritters from the oil and place on a paper towel-lined plate to drain excess oil.",
    "Sprinkle the fritters with confectioners' sugar and serve warm."
  ],
